Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

&amp;nbsp;






 PRINTERSCLAN





 &amp;nbsp;





 &amp;nbsp;


 &amp;nbsp;



 Dear Ray Girard We hope this email finds you well.
 We appreciate you reaching out about issues with your
 HP printer
 HJKAS









 Wi-Fi / Wireless setup (Windows)



 In the first step, connect the printer to WiFi.


 Then, download the printer driver from the official page.



 Next, double-tap the downloaded file.


 Now, you have to complete the installation steps.


 In the next step, tap the Window key + R.


 Next, the Run dialogue box will open.


 Now, enter “control/name Microsoft.DevicesAndPrinters.”



 After that, click the OK button.


 Then, the Devices and Printers folder will open.


 Next, your screen will display the Add Printer option.



 Click the Add Printer button and follow the prompts.






 Wi-Fi / Wireless setup (Mac)


 Firstly, you will need to turn on the Mac device and
 printer.


 Next, connect the printer to the wireless network.


 Now, go to the official page and download the printer
 driver.


 Then, complete the driver installation process.


 After that, go to the Apple Menu.


 In the menu, you have to click the System and Preferences
 option.


 On the next screen, select the Printers and Scanners
 option.


 Thereafter, you need to click the “+” sign and add the
 printer.


 From the pop-up window, choose your printer.


 Then, tap on the Add button.


 After adding your printer, its icon will appear on the
 screen.


 Finally! You are all set on a Mac device.











 &amp;nbsp;





 If your issue is still not resolved or you&#039;re unable to follow these
 instructions, contact our troubleshooting experts, who will diagnose the
 specific problem you&#039;re facing. Our certified experts will help you resolve
 the issue over the phone CALL OUR EXPERTS +1-512-885-1530.










 &amp;nbsp;




 &amp;copy; https://printersclan.com



 &amp;nbsp;


--B_ALT_68b358ea6b8321.98010133
